# Moira prompt templates. Empty, and intended to stay that way.
#
# Moira consults no model. A projection is a least-squares slope and a division
# - see agents/capacity/forecast.py - and there is nothing for a model to add
# to two numbers and an R² that would not be a paraphrase of them.
#
# The directory exists because tests/unit/test_repo_structure.py requires every
# agent to ship one. The TODO that was here said "populate this directory", and
# a TODO that must never be actioned trains people to ignore TODOs.
#
# Phase: 5 - Proactive Flow
